## The throne room

@hollow{emotion="angry"}: You. The Wishkeeper. Do you know what it is to be hungry for a thousand years?
@hollow: Every star I swallowed, I stayed hungry. Every one. Nothing fills the dark.
@narrator{when="count('bondRank', ['_', 'r3']) >= 1"}: Someone who is sworn to you steps up at your shoulder, without being asked.
@narrator{when="count('bondRank', ['_', 'r3']) == 0"}: Your heroes hang back. They've come this far for the stars. Maybe not yet for you.
<branch id="c3s8Choice" prompt="The Hollow King is between you and the lanterns.">
  <choice id="strike" label="Strike him down.">
    @hollow{emotion="angry"}: Then I'll be hungry in the ground instead.
  </choice>
  <choice id="offer" label="Offer him a star.">
    @hollow{emotion="smug"}: A gift? To me? That's... not how this goes.
    @lumi{emotion="surprised"}: That's MY star! That's... okay, fine, give it to him. See what happens.
  </choice>
</branch>

## To be continued

@narrator: The lanterns crack open, a thousand at once. The sky fills in, not all the way, but enough.
@lumi{emotion="happy"}: We did it! Mostly! Chapter 4 when the stars are ready!
